'''In Bloom''' (オハナガサイタ, ''Ohana ga Saita'', '''The Flower Blossomed''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': "Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

'''Pre 4.7''': "Resistant" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

